Asks a few questions (German or English), creates your fleet folder with the
inventory, settings and encrypted secrets, installs the Ansible collection and then
offers to prepare the SD card for each device.

    tools/slideshow-setup              # German by default, --lang en for English

Works on Linux, macOS and Windows (inside WSL2). Needs: python3, ansible, mtools, ssh-keygen.
See docs/SETUP.md (English) or docs/ANLEITUNG.md (Deutsch).
"""

